{
  "$comment": "Chat image generation on the studio pipeline (BYOK,). dispatch: which chat sends move to the studio executor; legacy = the existing chat image path, unchanged. baseUrl: executor base derived from the chat connection effective address (spec.baseUrlRule). wire: the same chat input (connectionBaseUrl -> full url) through the new pipeline; bodyExcludes and the legacy body keys come from request_shape_contract.v1 (the frozen legacy chat lock), so sameAsLegacy=true proves the request did not change. persist: the assistant message shape both paths must produce. errorMap: studio errorKind -> chat failure category; each end maps the category onto its own chat error type. Recomputed by scripts/studio-contracts-check.mjs.",
  "contractId": "chat_image_dispatch.v1",
  "version": 1,
  "spec": {
    "chatParams": {
      "aspect": "1:1",
      "resolution": "1K",
      "quality": "standard",
      "n": 1
    },
    "studioRoutes": [
      "openai_images",
      "xai_images",
      "openrouter_images",
      "minimax_image_generation",
      "dashscope_multimodal"
    ],
    "legacyProviderKinds": [
      "relay"
    ],
    "firstImage": {
      "slot": 1,
      "role": "base"
    },
    "laterImages": {
      "role": "element"
    },
    "errorMap": {
      "refused": "upstream_400",
      "auth": "invalid_key",
      "insufficient_balance": "quota_exceeded",
      "rate_limited": "rate_limited",
      "invalid_param": "upstream_400",
      "model_unavailable": "model_unavailable",
      "upstream_error": "upstream_502",
      "timeout": "network",
      "network": "network",
      "decode_failed": "empty_response",
      "storage_full": "upstream_507"
    },
    "baseUrlRule": "Executor base = the chat connection effective address: trim; empty or missing -> null (stay legacy); no scheme -> prefix https://; trim trailing slashes; no host -> null. dashscope_multimodal only: drop one trailing /compatible-mode/v1 or /api/v1 (case-sensitive), then append /api/v1. Other routes: as-is."
  },
